      "value": "Been trying to work with this again lately. On the latest version of the android app it sometimes reports a value back. If you move your finger at any kind of steady speed though it will keep reporting 0 until the speed changes again (as far as I can tell)\n\nFor now I'm getting around it by using MouseX/Y on mobile as an override.",
